{"t":"Coconut","s":"coconut-540e0","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Coconut_c619fa.gif","q":3,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Coconut</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Coconut\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Coconut_c619fa.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Plants, Animal Products, Food and Drink<br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Food\">Food</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">4.80 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">100-500 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"consumable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Consumable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"regenseconds\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Regeneration</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">216 seconds<br/><small>(18% full)</small></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6.0<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">November 3, 2000<br/>Version 6.0 Beta</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20050713140202&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Coconut_c619fa.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a coconut.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 4.80 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Slurp.</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Before the summer update 2005, coconuts were very rare as they were only dropped by <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon\">Demons</a>. Since they are now dropped by <a href=\"#/wiki/Sibang\">Sibangs</a> instead, they have drastically dropped in value. Putting a <a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Herb\">Blood Herb</a> over 10 Coconuts will make a very nice decoration background.\n</p><p>You can make <a href=\"#/wiki/Coconut%20Milk\">Coconut Milk</a> from them by using a <a href=\"#/wiki/Juice%20Squeezer\">Juice Squeezer</a> on it.\n</p><p>Needed in <a href=\"#/quest/the-paradox-tower-quest\">The Paradox Tower Quest</a>.\n7 vials of <a href=\"#/wiki/Coconut%20Milk\">Coconut Milk</a> are needed for the <a href=\"#/quest/hot-cuisine-quest\">Hot Cuisine Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>This item was once only lootable from Demons. Therefore, they used to have a price range of 2,000 - 8,000 gp each. After <a href=\"#/wiki/Sibang\">Sibangs</a> were introduced they became much easier to obtain, and go for a price of anywhere from nothing at all to 3 gp each.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sibang\">Sibang</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Tropical%20Desolator\">Tropical Desolator</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buyfrom\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th>NPC</th><th>Location</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Sessek\">Sessek</a></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Marapur\">Marapur</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">8 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Apes\">Apes</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Herb\">Blood Herb</a></li><li>Bosses</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Coconut%20Milk\">Coconut Milk</a></li><li>Coconut Palm</li><li>Cooking</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Daily%20Respawns\">Daily Respawns</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Demon\">Demon</a></li><li>Desert Plants</li><li>Flora and Minerals</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Food\">Food</a></li><li>Fruit</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/hot-cuisine-quest\">Hot Cuisine Quest</a></li><li>Iks</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Invisibility\">Invisibility</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Juice%20Squeezer\">Juice Squeezer</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sessek\">Sessek</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sibang\">Sibang</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-paradox-tower-quest\">The Paradox Tower Quest</a></li><li>Trees</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Tropical%20Desolator\">Tropical Desolator</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["hot-cuisine-quest","illuminator-outfits-quest","the-paradox-tower-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"the-paradox-tower-quest","quest":"The Paradox Tower Quest","step":"1-11","n":16,"title":"Puzzle das frutas","kind":"needed","coords":[]},{"slug":"hot-cuisine-quest","quest":"Hot Cuisine Quest","step":"2-3","n":10,"title":"Prato 4: Tropical Fried Terrorbird","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":33068,"y":32531,"z":6,"label":"Jean Pierre"}]},{"slug":"illuminator-outfits-quest","quest":"Illuminator Outfits Quest","step":"1-5","n":21,"title":"Matar o Tropical Desolator e ver o loot","kind":"mention","coords":[]}],"buy":[{"npc":"Sessek","where":"Marapur","price":8,"pos":{"x":33741,"y":32769,"z":5},"href":"#/wiki/Sessek"}],"drops":[{"creat